#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:4
msgid "Visualizer Streaming Camera View"
msgstr "可视化器相机流视图"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:8
msgid ""
"For general visualizer documentation, see "
":doc:`/source/concepts/visualization`."
msgstr "可视化器的通用说明见 :doc:`/source/concepts/visualization` 。"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:10
msgid ""
"The visualizer streaming camera view is a live monitoring and debugging "
"tool. It combines ground-truth camera frames from multiple environments "
"(RGB, depth, segmentation, or surface normals) into a single panel that "
"updates every step, either following robots automatically or streaming from "
"existing scene camera sensors."
msgstr ""
"可视化器的相机流视图用于实时观察和调试。它将多个环境的相机真值帧（RGB、深度、分割或表面法线）组合到同一个面板中，每一步都会更新。相机可以自动跟随机器人，也可以使用场景中已有的相机传感器。"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:17
msgid ""
"The streaming camera view is supported in the Kit, Newton GL, Rerun, and "
"Viser visualizers. The Newton RTX visualizer accepts the configuration but "
"does not display the panel (experimental)."
msgstr ""
"Kit、Newton GL、Rerun 和 Viser 可视化器支持相机流视图。Newton RTX 可视化器接受该配置，但不会显示面板（实验性功能）。"

