#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:59
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:67
msgid ""
"**Kit** launches the streaming view as a separate **Streaming View** "
"viewport, selectable from the Viewport tabs; it can also be placed side by "
"side with the default interactive viewport for dual monitoring."
msgstr ""
"**Kit** 将相机流视图作为独立的 **Streaming View** 视口启动，可通过 Viewport "
"标签页选择；也可以将其与默认交互视口并排放置，同时观察两种画面。"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:71
msgid ""
"**Newton GL** shows a **Streaming View** section in the HUD sidebar with a "
"**Hide** / **Open** toggle to show or hide the panel, and a source dropdown "
"to select between different camera sensors."
msgstr ""
"**Newton GL** 在 HUD 侧栏中显示 **Streaming View** 区域，提供 **Hide** / **Open** "
"开关来隐藏或显示面板，并通过来源下拉菜单选择不同的相机传感器。"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:77
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:79
msgid ""
"Running ``run_tiled_camera_visualizer.py`` demonstrates two ways to use the "
"streaming camera view:"
msgstr "运行 ``run_tiled_camera_visualizer.py`` 可演示相机流视图的两种用法："

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:82
msgid ""
"auto-created cameras pointed at and following moving AnymalD robots, shown "
"in the Kit visualizer"
msgstr "自动创建相机，朝向并跟随移动的 AnymalD 机器人，在 Kit 可视化器中显示"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:83
msgid ""
"streaming from existing wrist-mounted robot cameras, shown in the Newton "
"visualizer"
msgstr "使用机器人已有的腕部相机传输画面，在 Newton 可视化器中显示"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:87
msgid "Example 1: Following AnymalD Robots"
msgstr "示例 1：跟随 AnymalD 机器人"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:108
msgid ""
"The script's ``KitVisualizerCfg`` creates cameras that point at and follow "
"each robot's base prim, offset by ``streaming_cam_eye`` (here ``(3.0, 3.0, "
"3.0)``; try ``(0, 0, 5)`` for a top-down view). Of the 256 environments, 36 "
"are randomly sampled for the camera view."
msgstr ""
"脚本中的 ``KitVisualizerCfg`` 会创建相机，朝向并跟随每个机器人的基座 prim；相机偏移量由 "
"``streaming_cam_eye`` 指定（此处为 ``(3.0, 3.0, 3.0)`` ；可以尝试 ``(0, 0, 5)`` "
"获取俯视画面）。相机视图从 256 个环境中随机抽取 36 个显示。"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:125
msgid "Example 2: Streaming from Robot-Mounted Cameras"
msgstr "示例 2：传输机器人搭载相机的画面"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:146
msgid ""
"The Galbot cube-stacking environment ships with wrist-mounted cameras giving"
" an egocentric view of the gripper, table, and cubes. The script's "
"``NewtonGLVisualizerCfg`` streams from the existing sensor at "
"``/World/envs/env_.*/Robot/head_camera_sim_view_frame/head_camera``; edit "
"``streaming_sensor_prim_path`` to show a different camera. Of the 25 "
"environments, 12 camera feeds are shown by default."
msgstr ""
"Galbot 立方体堆叠环境自带腕部相机，可以从第一视角观察夹爪、桌面和立方体。脚本中的 ``NewtonGLVisualizerCfg`` 使用 "
"``/World/envs/env_.*/Robot/head_camera_sim_view_frame/head_camera`` "
"处的已有传感器传输画面；修改 ``streaming_sensor_prim_path`` 可显示其他相机。默认显示 25 个环境中 12 "
"个相机的画面。"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:165
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使用方法"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:168
msgid "Configuration notes"
msgstr "配置说明"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:170
msgid ""
"To customize streaming camera behavior, edit the highlighted "
"``VisualizerCfg`` fields in ``run_tiled_camera_visualizer.py``:"
msgstr ""
"要自定义相机流行为，请修改 ``run_tiled_camera_visualizer.py`` 中高亮的 ``VisualizerCfg`` 字段："

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:173
msgid ""
"For auto-created cameras, ``streaming_cam_target_prim_path`` chooses the "
"followed prim and ``streaming_cam_eye`` sets the camera offset from that "
"prim.  Defaults to ``None``, which causes the visualizer to adopt the first "
"scene camera it discovers at init; no explicit path is needed when a "
"``TiledCamera`` sensor is already in the scene."
msgstr ""
"对于自动创建的相机， ``streaming_cam_target_prim_path`` 选择跟随的 prim， "
"``streaming_cam_eye`` 设置相机相对该 prim 的偏移量。目标路径默认为 ``None`` "
"，此时可视化器会在初始化时采用发现的第一个场景相机；场景已有 ``TiledCamera`` 传感器时，无需显式指定路径。"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:177
msgid ""
"For existing scene cameras, ``streaming_sensor_prim_path`` must match an "
"Isaac Lab :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.Camera` sensor prim path in the selected"
" task."
msgstr ""
"对于已有的场景相机， ``streaming_sensor_prim_path`` 必须与所选任务中的 Isaac Lab "
":class:`~isaaclab.sensors.Camera` 传感器 prim 路径匹配。"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:179
msgid ""
"``streaming_envs`` controls how many environment tiles are shown. Pass an "
"``int`` to randomly sample that many environments, or a ``list[int]`` to pin"
" specific environment indices."
msgstr ""
"``streaming_envs`` 控制显示的环境格数。传入 ``int`` 可随机抽取指定数量的环境，传入 ``list[int]`` "
"则可固定显示指定索引的环境。"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:181
msgid ""
"``streaming_gt_types`` selects which ground-truth types are shown, e.g. "
"``[\"rgb\", \"depth\", \"segmentation\", \"normals\"]``."
msgstr ""
"``streaming_gt_types`` 选择显示的真值类型，例如 ``[\"rgb\", \"depth\", \"segmentation\","
" \"normals\"]`` 。"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:183
msgid ""
"``streaming_depth_min`` / ``streaming_depth_max`` set the depth colormap "
"range in metres."
msgstr "``streaming_depth_min`` / ``streaming_depth_max`` 设置深度色图的范围，单位为米。"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:187
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:189
msgid ""
"If a generated view fails with a missing prim error, verify that "
"``streaming_cam_target_prim_path`` resolves in each selected environment; "
"common template forms are ``/World/envs/*/...`` and "
"``/World/envs/env_.*/...``.  In most cases you can leave it as ``None`` and "
"let the visualizer adopt an existing scene camera automatically."
msgstr ""
"如果生成视图时提示缺少 prim，请确认 ``streaming_cam_target_prim_path`` "
"在每个所选环境中都能解析到目标；常用路径模板为 ``/World/envs/*/...`` 和 ``/World/envs/env_.*/...`` "
"。多数情况下，可以保留 ``None`` ，让可视化器自动采用已有的场景相机。"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:193
msgid ""
"If an existing-camera view reports that no Isaac Lab camera owns the prim, "
"check that ``streaming_sensor_prim_path`` matches a "
":class:`~isaaclab.sensors.Camera` sensor in the task."
msgstr ""
"如果已有相机视图提示该 prim 不属于任何 Isaac Lab 相机，请检查 ``streaming_sensor_prim_path`` "
"是否与任务中的 :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.Camera` 传感器匹配。"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:195
msgid ""
"If the depth panel shows a flat color, adjust ``streaming_depth_min`` and "
"``streaming_depth_max`` to bracket the expected depth range in your scene."
msgstr ""
"如果深度面板只显示单一颜色，请调整 ``streaming_depth_min`` 和 ``streaming_depth_max`` "
"，使其覆盖场景中预期的深度范围。"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:197
msgid ""
"If the view is too expensive, reduce ``streaming_envs``, ``--num_envs``, or "
"the camera resolution."
msgstr "如果视图开销过大，可减小 ``streaming_envs`` 、 ``--num_envs`` 或相机分辨率。"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:202
msgid ""
"**Newton MJWarp with** ``replicate_physics=True`` **and auto-created "
"cameras**"
msgstr "**Newton MJWarp 在** ``replicate_physics=True`` **时使用自动创建的相机**"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:204
msgid ""
"With ``replicate_physics=True``, only ``env_0`` has a USD prim after physics"
" initialization. Cameras for the remaining environments (``env_1`` through "
"``env_{N-1}``) are dropped, causing initialization to fail::"
msgstr ""
"设置 ``replicate_physics=True`` 后，物理初始化完成时只有 ``env_0`` 保留 USD prim。其余环境（ "
"``env_1`` 至 ``env_{N-1}`` ）的相机会被移除，导致初始化失败::"

#: source/features/visualizer_tiled_camera.rst:211
msgid ""
"**Workaround**: set ``streaming_sensor_prim_path`` to a scene camera that "
"was declared in the scene config before physics init (for example, a "
"``TiledCamera`` on a vision-based task)."
msgstr ""
"**解决方法** ：将 ``streaming_sensor_prim_path`` 指向在物理初始化前就已声明于场景配置中的相机（例如视觉任务中的 "
"``TiledCamera`` ）。"

